  "title": "Digital Presence Foundation: LinkedIn Optimization & 30-Day Content Strategy",
  "content": "## Plan Overview\n\nThis plan builds a comprehensive digital presence foundation in parallel tracks, then synthesizes everything into a final deliverable.\n\n**Track 1 - Research:** Gather current best practices for LinkedIn profile optimization and content strategy trends for B2B SaaS marketing professionals on LinkedIn and Twitter/X.\n\n**Track 2 - Profile Optimization:** Create a detailed LinkedIn profile optimization guide tailored to the user's role, positioning, and target audience.\n\n**Track 3 - Content Strategy:** Build the 30-day content calendar with platform-specific tactics, content pillars, templates, and engagement playbook.\n\n**Final Synthesis:** Combine all components into one cohesive, actionable deliverable.\n\nThe user's constraints are clear: Senior Marketing Manager at B2B SaaS company, 3-4 hrs/week capacity, practical data-driven angle, targeting marketing pros and startup founders. Uncertainty is low — we have all the context needed — so we parallelize research and then synthesize.",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "goal": "Research current LinkedIn profile optimization best practices for 2025-2026, specifically for B2B SaaS marketing professionals. Focus on: headline formulas, About section structure, keyword optimization for LinkedIn search/SEO, Featured section strategy, Skills & Endorsements optimization, banner image best practices, and Creator Mode settings. Gather at least 3-5 expert sources.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Research current LinkedIn and Twitter/X content strategy best practices for B2B thought leaders in 2025-2026. Focus on: optimal posting frequency and times for both platforms, high-performing content formats (carousels, text posts, threads, polls, short video), algorithm preferences, hashtag strategy, engagement tactics for growing from ~750 LinkedIn and ~200 Twitter/X followers, and cross-posting strategies. Also research what top B2B SaaS marketing thought leaders are doing on these platforms for inspiration.",
      "tool_name": "spawn_sub_agent",
      "depends_on": []
    },
    {
      "goal": "Using the LinkedIn profile optimization research, create a comprehensive LinkedIn Profile Optimization Guide for a Senior Marketing Manager at a B2B SaaS company ('Innovate Solutions'). The user's unique angle is 'practical, data-driven B2B content strategy and enablement' targeting marketing professionals in B2B SaaS and startup founders. Include: (1) Optimized headline with 3 variations to choose from, (2) Rewritten About/Summary section (~300 words) with keywords, (3) Banner image recommendations with specific text/design suggestions, (4) Featured section strategy with 3-5 recommended pins, (5) Experience section optimization tips, (6) Skills to add/prioritize (top 10), (7) Creator Mode and newsletter recommendations, (8) Custom URL and contact info tips. Make everything specific and actionable.",
      "tool_name": "reasoning",
      "depends_on": [0]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Using the content strategy research, create a complete 30-Day Content Strategy for LinkedIn and Twitter/X. The user is a Senior Marketing Manager at a B2B SaaS company with the angle 'practical, data-driven B2B content strategy and enablement.' They have 3-4 hours/week and prefer shorter tips, quick industry analysis, curated insights, and occasional short case studies. Target audience: B2B SaaS marketing professionals and startup founders. Include: (1) 4 content pillars with descriptions, (2) Weekly posting cadence for each platform (LinkedIn: 3-4x/week, Twitter/X: daily or near-daily), (3) Full 30-day calendar with specific post topics, format (text/carousel/thread/poll), platform, and estimated creation time, (4) 5 reusable content templates/frameworks (e.g., 'Hot Take' format, 'Data Insight' format, 'Tool Tip Tuesday'), (5) Engagement playbook: daily 15-min routine for commenting, connecting, and growing reach, (6) Cross-posting strategy between platforms, (7) KPIs to track weekly. Ensure total weekly time stays within 3-4 hours.",
      "tool_name": "reasoning",
      "depends_on": [1]
    },
    {
      "goal": "Synthesize the LinkedIn Profile Optimization Guide and the 30-Day Content Strategy into one cohesive, well-structured final deliverable. Organize it as: Part 1 - LinkedIn Profile Optimization (with checklist), Part 2 - 30-Day Content Strategy (with calendar, templates, and engagement playbook), Part 3 - Quick-Start Action Plan (prioritized first-week actions to get started immediately). Ensure consistency between the profile positioning and the content strategy themes. Add a time budget breakdown showing how the 3-4 hours/week maps to specific activities.",
